<item>
            <title>[LU-20669] Data Snapshot and Clone (Reflink) for Regular Files</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20669</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This document presents the incremental Redirect-on-Write data snapshot, reuse the Lustre FLR mirror framework, each snapshot is actual a readonly FLR mirror and provide the point-in-time data recovery for regular files;&lt;br/&gt;
Moreover, based on snapshot, it is easy to enhance it to support read-only or writable clone (reflink) for Lustre. &lt;/p&gt;</description>
